redfin 1218: Touch ID catacomb saves commit and load: master component, save info, session load (kern.sweet_mesa_catacomb bits)

BiometricSupport always appends the master component (user 0xffffffff, master.cat) to a catacomb save and runs
commitWrite only for the last component, so 61 master -> 0xe00002c7 left every save in Catacomb/prepare/. loadCatacomb
sends NoCatacomb(-1) and loads no user while the master's 60 state lacks bit 0. kern.sweet_mesa_catacomb is a bit
mask now (1 = 1206 as before): +2 master component (60 master entry, kernel SWCM blob for 61/62/63/64), +4 save info
in 40 (+0xc last save unix time, +0x14 loaded && dirty: saves after unlocks), +8 per-biometrickitd-session load
(not loaded on open, same-blob 64 without a TA reload). Default 0 / 1: unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013SvAC4dCbJuYfzxCtCk4D8
